      "writtenOn": "2021-10-08T08:40:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I need to change odrefresh.rs to not use (unsigned) VMADDR_CID_ANY to just \"--use-compilation-os\u003d-1\", otherwise the unsigned int is too large for the parsing to success.\n\nWell tbh -1 is much more elegant, but a CID should really be unsigned: https://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man7/vsock.7.html\nWe are hugely inconsistent about this though throughout the codebase.\n\n\u003e I should have mentioned that the related ART change requires *CLASSPATH to be defined.  I had a local hack to hard-code the string manually for now.  I\u0027m working on running derive_classpath in the VM. We\u0027ll also need b/201788989.\n\nAck",
